From 8936c0caee2977ff3e4ac045dbe2769c512aa780 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:38:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pokemon met surfing in Johto in line with the land beside
 them

Patches 0027 and 0028 raised walking levels only, so the water kept
HeartGold's own ranges (Lv. 10-29 at most towns and routes, Lake of Rage
5-23, Blackthorn 2-23). Each water table is tied to the boss a player
faces next when they can first surf there (Chuck, since Morty gives
Surf; Pryce; Clair; the rival on Victory Road) and its surfing slots move
into the same band, 75-85% of that boss's average. A rare fifth slot that
was above its table stays two levels over the band. Fishing, Rock Smash
and the post-game areas are unchanged. Generated by
tools/hack/surf_wild.py.
